sca Archaeological Park"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" One of these sites, the Son Ferrer tomb, was excavated from 2000 through 2009, a joint project of the University of the Balearic Islands, University of Barcelona, and University of Valencia.","title":"Puig de sa Morisca Archaeological Park"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" In addition, it includes Balearic flora found within a 10 km radius.","title":"Puig de sa Morisca Archaeological Park"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Barcelona and Valencia
